sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as 调用方
    participant Store as PaperExecutionStore
    participant Base as BasePersistence<PaperExecution>
    participant Repo as FileSystemRepository
    participant File as .v121-data/paper_executions.jsonl

    Note over Caller,File: 初始化流程
    Caller->>Store: new PaperExecutionStore()
    Store->>Base: constructor(repo)
    Base->>Repo: queryAll("paper_executions")
    Repo->>File: readFileSync + split + JSON.parse
    File-->>Repo: 记录数组
    Repo-->>Base: Record<string,unknown>[]
    Base->>Base: cache.set(id, record) 遍历
    Base-->>Store: 初始化完成

    Note over Caller,File: save 流程
    Caller->>Store: save(ex)
    Store->>Base: save(ex) [覆写]
    Base->>Base: cache.set(ex.id, {...ex})
    Base->>Base: flushToDisk()
    Base->>Repo: clear("paper_executions")
    Repo->>File: unlinkSync
    File-->>Repo: ok
    Base->>Repo: save("paper_executions", ex)
    Repo->>File: appendFileSync (JSONL)
    File-->>Repo: ok
    Repo-->>Base: ok
    Base-->>Store: ok

    Note over Caller,File: findById 流程
    Caller->>Store: findById("abc")
    Store->>Base: findById("abc")
    Base->>Base: cache.get("abc")
    Base-->>Store: {...record} (浅拷贝)
    Store-->>Caller: PaperExecution | undefined

    Note over Caller,File: delete 流程
    Caller->>Store: delete("abc")
    Store->>Base: delete("abc")
    Base->>Base: cache.delete("abc")
    Base->>Base: flushToDisk()
    Base->>Repo: clear + 逐条 save
    Repo-->>Base: ok
    Base-->>Store: ok
